=== a second SIGTERM still saves
$ clice index --workers 1
  Indexing interrupted; progress saved. Rerun `clice index` to resume.
  exit 130
$ clice index
  Indexed 5 translation units in #s: 6 file shards (# KB), 6 symbols.
  Session log: ${WS}/.clice/logs/${SESSION}
  exit 0

=== SIGHUP saves
$ clice index --workers 1
  Indexing interrupted; progress saved. Rerun `clice index` to resume.
  exit 130
$ clice index
  Indexed 5 translation units in #s: 6 file shards (# KB), 6 symbols.
  Session log: ${WS}/.clice/logs/${SESSION}
  exit 0
